rop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=95a968edd77e78d10e51d1da8e25229a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3780c8bd/uploads/origins/b5a58b93-cad6-4ee0-aa80-698e50c53a25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=95a968edd77e78d10e51d1da8e25229a, https://si.imgix.net/3780c8bd/uploads/origins/b5a58b93-cad6-4ee0-aa80-698e50c53a25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6d94706ebc270a9782611f5329cef981 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3780c8bd/uploads/origins/b5a58b93-cad6-4ee0-aa80-698e50c53a25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=56e54b78f68cb197ea23586ccc0303dd 3x"}, "body": "I'm so sorry I accidentally wrote your name wrong!\nNice to meet you! I fell in love with the style of your latest illustrations at first sight!\nI'd like to send you a request.\n\nWhat I'd like to ask for this time are my original characters—or rather, my avatars.\nI've compiled detailed reference materials in the link below.\n\n\nThe intended uses are:\n･Personal enjoyment (looking at them in my free time to make me smile, using them as desktop wallpaper, etc.)\n･Icons/headers for YouTube and Discord (I will credit you, Opale!)\nThat is all!\n\nI apologize for bothering you during such a busy time, but I would appreciate it if you could consider my request.\n\nRinraku\n\n\n\n\nCharacter Details/Background\n\n✦Character Details\n\nThe brown-haired one: “Rin” 20 years old, 160 cm\n\nLong dark brown hair (tied slightly to the back right) and orange eyes. Her distinctive feature is the two patterns on her cheeks.\nShe makes a conscious effort to maintain a gentle expression.\nHer tail isn’t a physical entity, so it appears and disappears at will. (Feel free to draw it or leave it out.)\n\nShe generally uses polite language and maintains a calm demeanor toward everyone.\nShe tries to be kind to younger people as an older sister figure, though she occasionally plays little pranks to tease them.\nCollege student.\n\n\n\nWhite-haired character: Raku ??? years old, 160 cm\n\nShe wears her white hair, tinged with a hint of jade green, in a carefree, unkempt style. Thanks to a mysterious power, her hair itself remains pristine. It’s enviable.\nOn both sides of her face, she wears \"mizura\"—bun-like hairstyles seen on haniwa figurines and men from the Kofun period.\nShe has eyes the same color as Rin’s, and the same pattern is engraved on her cheeks.\nThree lights glow in his pupils. In the dark, you can see them glowing slightly. (They look like inverted Mickey Mouse ears of the same size.)\nHe has seven pairs of ears on his head, each facing a different direction.\nHe has rounded eyebrows.\nHis entire body is covered in tattoo-like patterns.\nGenderless.\nHe has no tail or human ears.\n\n\nRarely comes out into the open.\nBasically has a gentle personality, but not as gentle as “Rin,” and has a strong laissez-faire side.\nBehaves with composure and lacks much human warmth.\n\n\n\nRelationship: Like two sides of the same coin, or yin and yang—they are a pair yet exist as a single entity.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vvHQn_mlXZiszXlfnd5LK8_yXPRVBnY3?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Opale/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3734548, "client_id": 499881, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4dfc8424e47b94b0b0807f526370be84", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4dfc8424e47b94b0b0807f526370be84, https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b9e03291710840d667fab14ed0819034 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e12914b745e72350d470973da189ea01 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dbf215a9ad2beb034579e249bf9831d8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dbf215a9ad2beb034579e249bf9831d8, https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=db1638109a2dd93684bfe74b1983b854 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d3bb2b05/uploads/origins/5be23f1a-3361-424b-869c-8db1e2283d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dcb9f99219f74da601830103d38cad09 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、Opaleさん！\n\n先生のイラストに惹かれて、ぜひうちの子のイラストをお願いしたくご連絡いたしました。\n\n彼女は見た目は普通の可愛い女の子ですが、実は裏社会で活動する傭兵で、夜になるとピストルで悪党と戦っています。\nそのため性格はあまり可愛らしくなく、他人に冷たく攻撃的で、すぐに偉そうな態度をとってしまい、そのせいでトラブルに巻き込まれることもあります。\n\n参考資料はこちらにまとめてあります：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Um2qI8y0AJBLVGkpu2jhNQuXk6hNw_hO?usp=sharing\n\nリンク先には複数の衣装がありますので、描きやすいものを選んでいただいて大丈夫です。\n\nもし可能でしたら、夜の街中やビルの屋上のような場所で、拳銃を持ってかっこよく決めている彼女を描いていただけないでしょうか。イラストの詳細や雰囲気については、先生のお好みにお任せいたします。\n\nお時間をいただきありがとうございます。どうぞよろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Opale/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3734548, "client_id": 140285, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_